# Line endings.
#
# Seven files (src/*.ts, CHANGELOG.md, tsconfig.json) were CRLF against an
# otherwise-LF repo with no .gitattributes — the same drift bfl-api normalised in
# e0c80c7. Any tool that rewrote a file flipped its endings and turned a
# one-line change into a whole-file diff (found during the 1.0 fetch migration).
#
# Store text as LF in the repo and check it out as LF everywhere. This is a
# Node CLI targeting macOS/Linux; there is no Windows-tooling reason to keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.bin   binary
*.tgz   binary
*.ico   binary

# Generated / vendored — keep diffs collapsed in review.
package-lock.json               linguist-generated=true
docs/openapi-snapshot-*.json    linguist-generated=true
